<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.recovery.offers ~ a recovery contact's key, minted for one face

`lares persona recovery-contact offer --prefix persona-<64 hex>` mints a recovery contact's fresh key for the face that prefix names and prints its card and the offer line the face's holder enrols.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ offer

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`offer` params=`prefix/persona-<hex> ~ mint a contact key for one face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ prefix

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`prefix` params=`takes/prefix needs/required ~ the face it guards, persona-<64 hex>`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/face-root ~ the recovery contact mints and keeps their own card`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.recovery.offers prefix/persona-<hex>]] ~ --prefix names no persona-<64 hex>`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ offered

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`offered` params=`exit/0 fields/[[prefix recoveryPubKey offer card]] ~ the card and the offer line`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares persona recovery-contact offer

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares persona recovery-contact offer]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~/ahu>>

